^{:go/end 471} (go/func isMemUser "Query if the given instruction only uses \"memory\" argument and we may try to skip some memory \"defs\" if they do not alias with its address.\nReturn index of pointer argument, index of \"memory\" argument, the access width and true on such instructions, otherwise return (-1, -1, 0, false).\n" [^{:tag (* Value)} v] :results [int int int64 bool]
